  "operative_text": "Section 4 (new section to N.D.C.C. ch. 62.1-02, Brandishing a dangerous weapon): Unless otherwise provided by law and subject to sections 12.1-17-04, 12.1-17-05, and 12.1-31-01, an individual may brandish a dangerous weapon while on property owned or leased by the individual."
